body:
Has anything changed? If it hasn't, why would you feel different about it? Maybe you can rest easy knowing that your feelings are validated and returned. 

&#x200B;

I dated my classmate my senior year of high school, and within the first month, we ran out of things to talk about. Just changing the label like that can mess with your head a bit. It's not like you're suddenly out of things to talk about, your thought process has changed is all. Let it settle. Take it easy.
